 "text": {
  "en": {
   "사각키 및 키홈 · 스텐 사각키 | [회사명] 베어링": "Sunk Keys & Keyways · Stainless Sunk Keys | [Company Name] Bearing",
   "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Sunk Keys & Their Keyways</p> <h2>사각키 및 키홈 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Sunk Keys and Their Corresponding Keyways</span></h2> <p> 축과 보스를 회전 방향으로 고정하는 가장 기본적인 사각형 키입니다. 일반 탄소강(SM45C) 소재가 기본이며, 부식 환경이나 식품·화학 설비용으로 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304 스테인리스 사각키</strong>도 함께 취급합니다. 아래에서 일반강 규격표, 스텐 규격표, KS 규격외 특수 사이즈를 구분해서 안내합니다. </p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Sunk Keys & Their Keyways</p> <h2>Sunk Keys and Keyways <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Sunk Keys and Their Corresponding Keyways</span></h2> <p> The most basic type of rectangular key used to lock a shaft and hub together in the rotational direction. Standard carbon steel (SM45C) is the base material, and we also carry <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304 stainless steel sunk keys</strong> for corrosive environments or food/chemical equipment. Below, the standard-steel spec table, the stainless spec table, and special non-KS sizes are listed separately. </p>",
   "<svg width=\"220\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"0\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">h</text> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 키 형상<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L=전체 길이 · b=나비 · h=높이</span></p>": "<svg width=\"220\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"0\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">h</text> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ Key Shape<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L=Overall Length · b=Width · h=Height</span></p>",
   "<svg width=\"150\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M15 60 A60 60 0 0 1 135 60\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"55\" y=\"45\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"70\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b1</text> <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"6\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t1</text> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <text x=\"30\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t2</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 키홈 단면<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">b1=축 키홈 나비 · b2=보스 키홈 나비(=b1) · t1=축 키홈 깊이 · t2=보스 키홈 깊이</span></p>": "<svg width=\"150\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M15 60 A60 60 0 0 1 135 60\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"55\" y=\"45\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"70\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b1</text> <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"6\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t1</text> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <text x=\"30\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t2</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ Keyway Cross-Section<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">b1=Shaft Keyway Width · b2=Hub Keyway Width (=b1) · t1=Shaft Keyway Depth · t2=Hub Keyway Depth</span></p>",
   "h 허용차<br>(자체)": "h Tolerance<br>(Itself)",
   "c<br>(모따기)": "c<br>(Chamfer)",
   "b1 허용차<br>(N9, 축홈)": "b1 Tolerance<br>(N9, Shaft Groove)",
   "b2 허용차<br>(Js9, 보스홈)": "b2 Tolerance<br>(Js9, Hub Groove)",
   "t1<br>(축 키홈 깊이)": "t1<br>(Shaft Keyway Depth)",
   "t2<br>(보스 키홈 깊이)": "t2<br>(Hub Keyway Depth)",
   "t1·t2<br>허용차": "t1·t2<br>Tolerance",
   "적용 축지름 d": "Applicable Shaft Diameter d",
   "단위: mm · 길이(일반 시판품)는 전 사이즈 300mm 고정입니다. b1(축 키홈)=b2(보스 키홈)=b 기준치수와 동일합니다.": "Unit: mm · Length (standard commercial product) is fixed at 300mm for all sizes. b1 (shaft keyway) = b2 (hub keyway) = the same as the nominal b dimension.",
   "<strong>재질 · 경도</strong><br> 재질: SM45C · 축 고정용": "<strong>Material · Hardness</strong><br> Material: SM45C · For Shaft Fixing",
   "<h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px;\"> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.3px;\"> <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"><path d=\"M12 2 L20 6 V12 C20 17 16.5 20.5 12 22 C7.5 20.5 4 17 4 12 V6 Z\"></path></svg> STS304 </span> 스텐 사각키 <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Stainless Steel Keys</span> </h3> <p> 습기·부식 환경이나 식품·화학 설비에 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304 스테인리스</strong> 소재 사각키입니다. 모두 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">300mm 길이 봉재</strong>로 공급되며, 필요한 길이로 절단해 사용합니다. </p>": "<h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px;\"> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.3px;\"> <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"><path d=\"M12 2 L20 6 V12 C20 17 16.5 20.5 12 22 C7.5 20.5 4 17 4 12 V6 Z\"></path></svg> STS304 </span> Stainless Sunk Keys <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Stainless Steel Keys</span> </h3> <p> Sunk keys made of <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304 stainless steel</strong>, used in humid/corrosive environments or food and chemical equipment. All are supplied as <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">300mm-long bar stock</strong>, to be cut to the required length before use. </p>",
   "<strong>재질 · 용도</strong><br> 재질: STS304 · 용도: 축 고정용": "<strong>Material · Application</strong><br> Material: STS304 · Application: For Shaft Fixing",
   "<h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--text-sub);\">■ KS 규격외 생산품 <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\">(Non-Standard Sizes)</span></h3> <p> KS 표준 호칭에 없는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">특수 치수</strong>도 별도 생산품으로 취급합니다. 일반강(SM45C)용과 스텐(STS304)용을 구분해서 안내하며, 재고·발주는 별도 문의가 필요합니다. </p>": "<h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--text-sub);\">■ Non-KS-Standard Products <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\">(Non-Standard Sizes)</span></h3> <p> We also carry <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">special dimensions</strong> not listed in the KS standard designations, as separately produced items. These are listed separately for standard steel (SM45C) and stainless (STS304), and stock and ordering require a separate inquiry. </p>",
   "일반강(SM45C) 규격외 b×h": "Non-Standard b×h (SM45C Standard Steel)",
   "단위: mm · 위는 규격외 생산품 중 대표 예시이며, 전체 목록은 훨씬 더 많습니다.": "Unit: mm · The above are representative examples of non-standard products; the full list is much larger.",
   "<span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; margin-right: 4px;\">STS304</span> 스텐 규격외 b×h×L": "<span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; margin-right: 4px;\">STS304</span> Non-Standard b×h×L (Stainless)",
   "단위: mm · 대표 예시이며, 6.35×6.35 · 7.92×7.92 · 12.7×12.7 등 인치 환산 사이즈를 포함해 전체 목록은 더 많습니다.": "Unit: mm · These are representative examples; the full list is larger and includes inch-converted sizes such as 6.35×6.35 · 7.92×7.92 · 12.7×12.7.",
   "※ 위 표는 당사 정식 규격표 원본을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 스텐(STS304) 사각키는 위와 같이 파란 배지로 구분해 표기했습니다. 규격외 사이즈는 재고 보유량이 사이즈별로 다르므로, 발주 전 반드시 견적 문의를 통해 재고와 최종 치수를 확인하시기 바랍니다.": "* The tables above were prepared based on our official spec sheet original. Stainless (STS304) sunk keys are marked with the blue badge shown above. Stock levels for non-standard sizes vary by size, so please be sure to confirm stock and final dimensions through a quote inquiry before ordering."
  },
  "ja": {
   "사각키 및 키홈 · 스텐 사각키 | [회사명] 베어링": "角キー・キー溝 ・ ステンレス角キー | [会社名] ベアリング",
   "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Sunk Keys & Their Keyways</p> <h2>사각키 및 키홈 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Sunk Keys and Their Corresponding Keyways</span></h2> <p> 축과 보스를 회전 방향으로 고정하는 가장 기본적인 사각형 키입니다. 일반 탄소강(SM45C) 소재가 기본이며, 부식 환경이나 식품·화학 설비용으로 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304 스테인리스 사각키</strong>도 함께 취급합니다. 아래에서 일반강 규격표, 스텐 규격표, KS 규격외 특수 사이즈를 구분해서 안내합니다. </p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Sunk Keys & Their Keyways</p> <h2>角キー及びキー溝 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Sunk Keys and Their Corresponding Keyways</span></h2> <p> 軸とボスを回転方向に固定する最も基本的な角形キーです。一般炭素鋼(SM45C)材質が標準であり、腐食環境や食品・化学設備用に<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304ステンレス角キー</strong>も取り扱っています。以下で一般鋼規格表、ステンレス規格表、KS規格外の特殊サイズを区分してご案内します。 </p>",
   "<svg width=\"220\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"0\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">h</text> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 키 형상<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L=전체 길이 · b=나비 · h=높이</span></p>": "<svg width=\"220\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"0\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">h</text> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ キー形状<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L=全長 ・ b=幅 ・ h=高さ</span></p>",
   "<svg width=\"150\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M15 60 A60 60 0 0 1 135 60\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"55\" y=\"45\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"70\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b1</text> <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"6\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t1</text> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <text x=\"30\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t2</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 키홈 단면<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">b1=축 키홈 나비 · b2=보스 키홈 나비(=b1) · t1=축 키홈 깊이 · t2=보스 키홈 깊이</span></p>": "<svg width=\"150\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M15 60 A60 60 0 0 1 135 60\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"55\" y=\"45\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"70\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b1</text> <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"63\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"63\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"6\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t1</text> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"></line> <text x=\"30\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\">t2</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ キー溝断面<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">b1=軸キー溝幅 ・ b2=ボスキー溝幅(=b1) ・ t1=軸キー溝深さ ・ t2=ボスキー溝深さ</span></p>",
   "h 허용차<br>(자체)": "h許容差<br>(自体)",
   "c<br>(모따기)": "c<br>(面取り)",
   "b1 허용차<br>(N9, 축홈)": "b1許容差<br>(N9、軸溝)",
   "b2 허용차<br>(Js9, 보스홈)": "b2許容差<br>(Js9、ボス溝)",
   "t1<br>(축 키홈 깊이)": "t1<br>(軸キー溝深さ)",
   "t2<br>(보스 키홈 깊이)": "t2<br>(ボスキー溝深さ)",
   "t1·t2<br>허용차": "t1・t2<br>許容差",
   "적용 축지름 d": "適用軸径 d",
   "단위: mm · 길이(일반 시판품)는 전 사이즈 300mm 고정입니다. b1(축 키홈)=b2(보스 키홈)=b 기준치수와 동일합니다.": "単位: mm ・ 長さ(一般市販品)は全サイズ300mm固定です。b1(軸キー溝)=b2(ボスキー溝)=b基準寸法と同じです。",
   "<strong>재질 · 경도</strong><br> 재질: SM45C · 축 고정용": "<strong>材質 ・ 硬度</strong><br> 材質: SM45C ・ 軸固定用",
   "<h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px;\"> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.3px;\"> <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"><path d=\"M12 2 L20 6 V12 C20 17 16.5 20.5 12 22 C7.5 20.5 4 17 4 12 V6 Z\"></path></svg> STS304 </span> 스텐 사각키 <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Stainless Steel Keys</span> </h3> <p> 습기·부식 환경이나 식품·화학 설비에 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304 스테인리스</strong> 소재 사각키입니다. 모두 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">300mm 길이 봉재</strong>로 공급되며, 필요한 길이로 절단해 사용합니다. </p>": "<h3 style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px;\"> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.3px;\"> <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"><path d=\"M12 2 L20 6 V12 C20 17 16.5 20.5 12 22 C7.5 20.5 4 17 4 12 V6 Z\"></path></svg> STS304 </span> ステンレス角キー <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Stainless Steel Keys</span> </h3> <p> 湿気・腐食環境や食品・化学設備に使用する<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304ステンレス</strong>材質の角キーです。すべて<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">300mm長の棒材</strong>で供給され、必要な長さに切断してご使用いただきます。 </p>",
   "<strong>재질 · 용도</strong><br> 재질: STS304 · 용도: 축 고정용": "<strong>材質 ・ 用途</strong><br> 材質: STS304 ・ 用途: 軸固定用",
   "<h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--text-sub);\">■ KS 규격외 생산품 <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\">(Non-Standard Sizes)</span></h3> <p> KS 표준 호칭에 없는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">특수 치수</strong>도 별도 생산품으로 취급합니다. 일반강(SM45C)용과 스텐(STS304)용을 구분해서 안내하며, 재고·발주는 별도 문의가 필요합니다. </p>": "<h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--text-sub);\">■ KS規格外生産品 <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\">(Non-Standard Sizes)</span></h3> <p> KS標準呼称にない<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">特殊寸法</strong>も別途生産品として取り扱っています。一般鋼(SM45C)用とステンレス(STS304)用を区分してご案内しており、在庫・発注は別途お問い合わせが必要です。 </p>",
   "일반강(SM45C) 규격외 b×h": "一般鋼(SM45C)規格外 b×h",
   "단위: mm · 위는 규격외 생산품 중 대표 예시이며, 전체 목록은 훨씬 더 많습니다.": "単位: mm ・ 上記は規格外生産品の代表例であり、全リストはさらに多くあります。",
   "<span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; margin-right: 4px;\">STS304</span> 스텐 규격외 b×h×L": "<span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f7fb3, #2f5d8a); color: #fff; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; margin-right: 4px;\">STS304</span> ステンレス規格外 b×h×L",
   "단위: mm · 대표 예시이며, 6.35×6.35 · 7.92×7.92 · 12.7×12.7 등 인치 환산 사이즈를 포함해 전체 목록은 더 많습니다.": "単位: mm ・ 代表例であり、6.35×6.35 ・ 7.92×7.92 ・ 12.7×12.7などインチ換算サイズを含め、全リストはさらに多くあります。",
   "※ 위 표는 당사 정식 규격표 원본을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 스텐(STS304) 사각키는 위와 같이 파란 배지로 구분해 표기했습니다. 규격외 사이즈는 재고 보유량이 사이즈별로 다르므로, 발주 전 반드시 견적 문의를 통해 재고와 최종 치수를 확인하시기 바랍니다.": "※ 上記の表は当社正式規格表の原本を基準に作成しました。ステンレス(STS304)角キーは上記のように青色バッジで区分して表記しています。規格外サイズは在庫保有量がサイズごとに異なるため、発注前に必ず見積もり問い合わせを通じて在庫と最終寸法をご確認ください。"
  },
  "zh": {
   "사각키 및 키홈 · 스텐 사각키 | [회사명] 베어링": "方键及键槽 · 不锈钢方键 | [公司名] 轴承",
   "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Sunk Keys & Their Keyways</p> <h2>사각키 및 키홈 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Sunk Keys and Their Corresponding Keyways</span></h2> <p> 축과 보스를 회전 방향으로 고정하는 가장 기본적인 사각형 키입니다. 일반 탄소강(SM45C) 소재가 기본이며, 부식 환경이나 식품·화학 설비용으로 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304 스테인리스 사각키</strong>도 함께 취급합니다. 아래에서 일반강 규격표, 스텐 규격표, KS 규격외 특수 사이즈를 구분해서 안내합니다. </p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Sunk Keys & Their Keyways</p> <h2>方键及键槽 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Sunk Keys and Their Corresponding Keyways</span></h2> <p> 用于在旋转方向上固定轴与轮毂的最基本的方形键。标准材质为普通碳钢(SM45C),同时针对腐蚀环境或食品、化工设备,也供应<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">STS304不锈钢方键</strong>。以下分别列出普通钢规格表、不锈钢规格表及KS标准外的特殊尺寸。 </p>",
   "<svg width=\"220\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"0\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">h</text> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 키 형상<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L=전체 길이 · b=나비 · h=높이</span></p>": "<svg width=\"220\" height=\"140\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 140\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"0\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">h</text> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"94\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">b</text> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 键的形状<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L=总长 · b=宽度 · h=高度</span></p>",
